Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

setEntryAngles [SimTalk]
Sets the name of the Entry Angle Table that is going to be assigned to the Turntable designated by
<Path>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.setEntryAngles(EntryAnglesTable:table)
Parameter
The parameter EntryAnglesTable of data type table designates the name of the table.
It contains the number of the Predecessor, the Name of the Predecessor, the Angle at which the
Connector from this predecessor connects to the Turntable, and at Which Side it turns toward the
predecessor.
The figure illustrates the position of the Entry Angle depending on the insertion direction of the Turntable.
setEntryAngles [SimTalk]
